.TH QSM-PVE-DIRECT-TERMINAL 8 "2026-10-20" "QSM Direct" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qsm-pve-direct-terminal \- Run the QSM media and local console service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsm-pve-direct-terminal
.SH DESCRIPTION
This daemon attaches to configured QEMU or container displays and runs the media transport. It is normally managed by qsm-pve-direct-terminal.service.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
See /usr/share/doc/qsm-pve-direct/README.Debian and
.UR https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd
the project repository
.UE .
